rminum completum seu substantiam\n[[576.14]] singularem adeoque esse unicum. </p>\n","number":"136.","title":"Divisiones","date":"[Sommer 1683 bis Winter 1685/86 (?)]"}
      </script>

      <!-- Detailed scholarly view with line numbers -->
      <div id="scholarly-view" class="text-view">
